    - target: {fileID: 8029915844618636220, guid: dfa28042ab3c6db41b734ff3c80fe1a9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[0]'
      value: <<Many of the washing machines are powered down>>
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8029915844618636220, guid: dfa28042ab3c6db41b734ff3c80fe1a9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[1]'
      value: To think that Public Laundries were supposed to be a shining example
        of cleanliness
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8029915844618636220, guid: dfa28042ab3c6db41b734ff3c80fe1a9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[2]'
      value: All I see is yet another sign of people leaving in a hurry. Strange.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8029915844618636220, guid: dfa28042ab3c6db41b734ff3c80fe1a9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[3]'
      value: Welp, might as well take advantage of the heap loads of scrap I could
        find here. Not like they'll mind at this point.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
